{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b8f3c9a1-4d5e-4f6a-9b2c-3d4e5f6a7b8c",
    "name": "Growlancer Backend",
    "description": "Complete Growlancer backend collection — Supabase Auth, REST API (PostgREST), Storage, Realtime, and all 24 Edge Functions.\n\n## Setup\n1. Open the collection → Variables tab.\n2. Set `SUPABASE_URL` = https://zttwsjehcgaicziqyxpq.supabase.co (already filled)\n3. Set `ANON_KEY` = your Supabase anon public key (Project Settings → API → anon public)\n4. Run the **Auth → Login** request first — it auto-saves the access token to `AUTH_TOKEN` via a test script.\n5. Auth-required edge functions use `Authorization: Bearer {{AUTH_TOKEN}}`.\n\n## Notes\n- Public functions (newsletter-subscribe, webhooks, cron) use the anon key as Bearer.\n- Auth-required functions will return 401 if `AUTH_TOKEN` is empty/expired.\n- Webhooks (paypal-webhook, razorpay-payout-webhook) are called by external providers — use the provided sample payloads for manual testing.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "SUPABASE_URL", "value": "https://zttwsjehcgaicziqyxpq.supabase.co", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "ANON_KEY", "value": "PASTE_YOUR_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY_HERE", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "AUTH_TOKEN", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "REFRESH_TOKEN", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "APP_URL", "value": "https://growlancer.vercel.app", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Auth (Supabase GoTrue)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Sign Up (Email)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{ANON_KEY}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"test@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"StrongPass123!\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"name\": \"Test User\",\n    \"role\": \"freelancer\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{SUPABASE_URL}}/auth/v1/signup",
              "host": ["{{SUPABASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "v1", "signup"]
            },
            "description": "Create a new account. Role: freelancer or client."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (Email + Password)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.access_token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('AUTH_TOKEN', json.access_token);",
                  "  console.log('AUTH_TOKEN saved:', json.access_token.slice(0, 20) + '...');",
                  "}",
                  "if (json.refresh_token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('REFRESH_TOKEN', json.refresh_token);",
                  "}",
                  "if (!json.access_token && !json.refresh_token) {",
                  "  console.warn('No tokens in response:', json);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{ANON_KEY}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"test@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"StrongPass123!\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{SUPABASE_URL}}/auth/v1/token?grant_type=password",
              "host": ["{{SUPABASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "v1", "token"],
              "query": [{ "key": "grant_type", "value": "password" }]
            },
            "description": "Login and auto-save the access token to AUTH_TOKEN variable."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.access_token) pm.collectionVariables.set('AUTH_TOKEN', json.access_token);",
                  "// Supabase rotates refresh tokens on every use — always save the new one",
                  "if (json.refresh_token) pm.collectionVariables.set('REFRESH_TOKEN', json.refresh_token);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{ANON_KEY}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refresh_token\": \"{{REFRESH_TOKEN}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{SUPABASE_URL}}/auth/v1/token?grant_type=refresh_token",
              "host": ["{{SUPABASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "v1", "token"],
              "query": [{ "key": "grant_type", "value": "refresh_token" }]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Current User",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{ANON_KEY}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{AUTH_TOKEN}}", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{SUPABASE_URL}}/auth/v1/user",
              "host": ["{{SUPABASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "v1", "user"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{ANON_KEY}}", "type": "text" },
